## AI Tools

- [YouTube Metadata Generator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/youtube-generator): AI-powered tool to generate catchy, click-worthy titles, descriptions, and tags.
- [AI Prompt Generator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/prompt-generator): Midjourney/SD prompt engineer, one-click high-quality prompts.
- [AI Weekly Report](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/weekly-report): Automatically transform scattered work records into professional reports.
- [AI Code Reviewer](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/code-reviewer): Senior AI architect performs Code Review, finds bugs and gives advice.
- [Video Script Generator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/video-script): AI-powered tool to generate viral short video scripts, including storyboards, visuals, subtitles, and voiceover.
- [AI Meeting Minutes](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/meeting-minutes): Automatically extract and organize messy meeting notes or transcripts into clear, structured meeting minutes.
- [AI Excel Formula Generator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/excel-formula): Describe what you want to do in natural language, and AI will generate the exact Excel or Google Sheets formula for you.
- [AI Matcher Regex Planner](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/regex): Translate your plain English descriptions into accurate Regular Expressions.
- [AI Logo & Avatar Designer](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/logo-generator): Core Concept / Symbol
- [AI Image Generator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/image-generator): Generate high-quality photorealistic images or artwork from text descriptions with multiple aspect ratios and styles.
- [AI SVG Generator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/svg-generator): Generate scalable, high-quality SVG vector illustrations or icon code directly from text descriptions.
- [Xiaohongshu AI Copywriter](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/xiaohongshu): Instantly generate viral Xiaohongshu (RED) posts with emojis and hashtags using AI.
- [AI Text Polisher](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/text-polisher): Uses top-tier AI models to instantly rewrite, polish, and adapt your texts to any tone.
- [AI Translator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/translator): Beyond traditional translation engines! Get highly accurate, native-sounding translations powered by AI context awareness.
- [Listing Generator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/listing-generator): AI-driven e-commerce listing generator. Creates titles, descriptions and tags in seconds.
- [Keyword Analyzer](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/keyword-analyzer): Deep-dive into e-commerce long-tail keywords, discovering hidden profitable niches.
- [Competitor Tracker](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/competitor-tracker): Analyze competitors, find weaknesses, and identify opportunities for your products.
- [Market Insights](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ai/market-insights): Acquire platform-specific market research reports, trends, and category dynamics.

## Dev Tools

- [JSON Formatter](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/json-formatter): Beautify, compress, and validate JSON data.
- [XML / JSON Converter](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/xml-to-json): Convert between XML, HTML structures, and JSON for API debugging, config migration, and structure inspection.
- [Text Diff Tool](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/text-diff): Quickly find differences between two texts or codes with line-by-line or word-by-word comparison.
- [Base64 Codec](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/base64): Quickly encode/decode Base64 online.
- [ASCII Table](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/ascii-table): Standard ASCII and control character reference.
- [URL Codec](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/url-encoder): Safely encode or decode URL components.
- [Hash Generator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/hash-generator): Generate MD5, SHA-1/256/512 hashes quickly.
- [Unicode Converter](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/unicode-converter): Convert between native characters and Unicode escape.
- [JWT Debugger](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/jwt-debugger): Decode and debug JSON Web Tokens locally with ease.
- [Regex Tester](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/regex-tester): Write and debug regular expressions in real-time with highlighting and grouping.
- [JSON to TypeScript](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/json-to-ts): Automatically infer and generate precise TypeScript interface definitions from JSON data.
- [Symmetric Crypto](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/crypto-symmetric): Securely encrypt or decrypt data using AES, DES, or TripleDES locally.
- [SM Crypto (SM2/3/4)](https://toolorbit.site/tools/dev/chinese-crypto): Chinese national standard encryption algorithms including SM2, SM3, and SM4.

