## E-commerce

- [Etsy Fee Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ecommerce/etsy-fee-calculator): Calculate Etsy listing, transaction and payment fees.
- [Etsy Offsite Ads Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ecommerce/etsy-offsite-ads-calculator): Estimate Etsy Offsite Ads fees at 12% or 15% and see how attributed orders affect profit.
- [Etsy Pricing Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ecommerce/etsy-pricing-calculator): Reverse-calculate the Etsy item price needed for your cost, shipping, target profit, and fee assumptions.
- [Etsy Regulatory & Currency Fee Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ecommerce/etsy-regulatory-fee-calculator): Estimate Etsy Regulatory Operating Fees by seller location plus the optional 2.5% currency conversion fee.
- [Stripe Fee Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ecommerce/stripe-fee-calculator): Estimate Stripe transaction fees and net payouts.
- [PayPal Fee Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ecommerce/paypal-fee-calculator): Estimate PayPal merchant fees, net payouts, and reverse invoice amounts.
- [Stripe vs PayPal Fee Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/ecommerce/stripe-vs-paypal-fee-calculator): Compare Stripe and PayPal fees, net payouts, and differences for the same payment amount.

