## Utility Tools

- [BMI Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/utility/bmi-calculator): Calculate BMI, weight category, and a healthy weight range from gender, age, height, and weight.
- [Age Calculator](https://toolorbit.site/tools/utility/age-calculator): Enter a birth date to calculate full age, total days up to today, and days until the next birthday.
- [World Timezone Compare](https://toolorbit.site/tools/utility/world-timezone-compare): Compare local times across 38 fixed UTC offsets from UTC-12:00 to UTC+14:00, with a draggable reference timeline for cross-timezone meetings.
- [MBTI Personality Test](https://toolorbit.site/tools/utility/mbti-personality-test): Answer 24 original preference questions to estimate a 16-type personality result with a low-poly portrait, orientation, analysis, and recommended tools.

## Editorial And Usage Notes

Most ToolOrbit utilities run directly in the browser so files, text, and developer data stay on the user device unless an AI-powered feature explicitly needs a model request.

ToolOrbit utilities are designed around practical browser workflows. Most non-AI tools process input locally in the browser. AI-assisted tools may send prompts to configured model APIs and should be reviewed before professional use.
